  "title": "@claude in GitHub: the Claude Code GitHub Action",
  "summary": "The Claude Code GitHub Action runs Claude in your repo's workflows. Mention @claude in an issue or PR and it answers or pushes a branch; give it a prompt and it runs on any event or schedule. /install-github-app sets it up; keep the key in a secret and cap turns and time.",
