  "id": "git-headless",
  "title": "Headless claude -p, and /loop",
  "summary": "claude -p runs one prompt with no conversation and exits, for scripts and CI. Pass its mode and tools on purpose (with no mode set anywhere it starts in Manual mode, which denies anything needing approval), cap turns and spend, and use JSON output to read the result. /loop repeats a prompt while a session stays open.",
